    "preamble": "Mohd. Shahjad vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 28 July, 2023 Author: Mahesh Chandra Tripathi Bench: Mahesh Chandra Tripathi High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2023:Ahc:152848-Db Court No. - 40 Case :- Writ - C No. - 23786 of 2023 Petitioner :- Mohd. Shahjad Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 3 Others",
    "facts": "The petitioner has challenged the order dated 15.03.2023 passed by the Assistant Commissioner (Food Safety and Drugs Administration), Moradabad by the license of his meat shop has been cancelled on the ground that a criminal case under Section 3/5/8 of Cow Slaughter Act is pending against him.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned Standing Counsel states that against the order impugned the petitioner has an efficacious remedy of filing an Appeal under Section 32 of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006 before the Commissioner Food Safety And Drugs Administration.",
